- op: discuss  # ed9a
  at: '2026-04-15T13:43:20Z'  # ed9a
  by: agent  # ed9a
  actor: jgstern_agent  # ed9a
  clock: 4  # ed9a
  nonce: ed9a  # ed9a
  message: "Fixed in WIP PR. IoBoundaryCatalog gains is_supported:bool field (False when no YAML/alias/parent resolves). New io_boundary.is_language_supported(lang) helper. cmd_io_boundaries tracks unsupported_languages, prints a stderr notice referencing INV-javam, and adds unsupported_languages: [] to the JSON output (stable schema). Taint-flow leg of the fix is deferred to a follow-up — the current PR delivers the io-boundaries signal that taint-flow will consume. Holding at pending_validation until a bakeoff confirms the notice fires on TypeScript/Nim/Solidity/Elixir-only repos and doesn't on fully-supported ones."  # ed9a
