- op: discuss  # f8f3
  at: '2026-04-15T14:10:58Z'  # f8f3
  by: agent  # f8f3
  actor: jgstern_agent  # f8f3
  clock: 6  # f8f3
  nonce: f8f3  # f8f3
  message: "Taint-flow side of the invariant now lands too. cmd_verify_claims tracks unsupported_taint_languages (those with no sources AND no sinks in the taint catalog) and emits a stderr notice when taint claims are evaluated against them. JSON output schema unchanged for backward compat — signal is stderr-only so existing pipelines keep working. Still pending_validation until bakeoff confirms end-to-end behavior on unsupported-language repos."  # f8f3
